lib/src/core/py_decompress.dart decodes the members of an archive as the
libraries that Python's zipfile module uses do, so that damaged data fails as
it fails there. Its inflate follows the rules of zlib (Copyright (C)
1995-2022 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler, zlib License), and its LZMA
decoder those of liblzma and the LZMA SDK, which are in the public domain.
Its bzip2 decoder is a port, altered for Dart, of libbzip2's decompress.c and
